WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.669 --> 00:00:18.231
downshifted and pedaled hard along the straightaway.

2
00:00:21.094 --> 00:00:26.659
Dirt and mud spattered her in the face, stinging her skin, but all she could see was the

3
00:00:26.739 --> 00:00:32.754
trail. At the end of the straightaway, the track made a hard turn.

4
00:00:33.595 --> 00:00:37.999
Riley hit the turn, her back tire sliding in the dirt and throwing her off balance.

5
00:00:40.581 --> 00:00:45.545
She stood up on the pedals and pulled back with her body, steadying the bike around the curve.

6
00:00:47.406 --> 00:00:52.210
In front of her, the trail took a fast dip down a hill and then traveled upward again.

7
00:00:53.011 --> 00:00:55.433
Riley thought she caught a glimpse of Quinn up ahead.

8
00:00:56.374 --> 00:01:02.209
Quinn had started thirty seconds before Riley, and she'd lost some time, but Riley had lost time too.

9
00:01:02.229 --> 00:01:08.092
"I just have to beat Quinn's overall time," Riley reminded herself.

10
00:01:08.112 --> 00:01:11.053
"I don't have to beat her across the finish line."

11
00:01:12.334 --> 00:01:16.756
Still, it would feel wonderful to cross the finish line ahead of Quinn!

12
00:01:17.756 --> 00:01:21.978
There was another straightaway after the hill—it was perfect for a fast sprint.

13
00:01:22.819 --> 00:01:25.760
Riley barreled down the track, her leg muscles burning.

14
00:01:28.332 --> 00:01:33.036
When she got over the hill, Quinn was ahead of her in the distance, but closer now.

15
00:01:33.056 --> 00:01:35.998
"Woo-hoo!" Riley thought.

16
00:01:36.559 --> 00:01:38.821
"Watch out, Quinn—here I come!"

17
00:01:39.902 --> 00:01:42.404
Quinn glanced over her shoulder and spotted Riley.

18
00:01:44.125 --> 00:01:47.988
She pedaled furiously and disappeared so fast, Riley was stunned.

19
00:01:50.790 --> 00:01:55.214
She couldn't help being impressed—Quinn sure knew what she was doing on her bike.

20
00:01:55.234 --> 00:01:59.053
"I do too," Riley told herself.

21
00:01:59.993 --> 00:02:03.275
She crouched low over the handlebars, pushing herself harder.

22
00:02:05.877 --> 00:02:11.340
Riley took several more curves easily, leaning into them confidently and holding her balance.

23
00:02:15.322 --> 00:02:17.583
A jump was coming up—the final one.

24
00:02:18.504 --> 00:02:21.806
She shifted gears, throwing a burst of speed into her bike.

25
00:02:24.827 --> 00:02:30.632
As she approached the jump, she gripped the handlebars and pedaled hard, rising in her seat to balance

26
00:02:30.672 --> 00:02:31.072
the bike.

27
00:02:32.874 --> 00:02:35.956
She sailed over the jump in a perfect arc.

28
00:02:38.718 --> 00:02:41.181
"Yes!" she hollered with delight.

29
00:02:43.062 --> 00:02:48.747
Her wheels landed together with a satisfying thump, and then Riley was pedaling furiously again.

30
00:02:51.049 --> 00:02:54.632
Soon she was closing the gap again, drawing closer to Quinn.

31
00:02:56.968 --> 00:03:01.572
As Riley pulled closer, she thought she saw Quinn's back wheel was wobbling.

32
00:03:01.592 --> 00:03:05.514
"Yikes," Riley thought.

33
00:03:05.534 --> 00:03:08.537
"That could be dangerous."

34
00:03:08.557 --> 00:03:11.939
"Go!" People standing on the sidelines roared at the girls.

35
00:03:11.959 --> 00:03:14.701
"Keep up your speed, Riley!"

36
00:03:15.161 --> 00:03:15.862
somebody yelled.

37
00:03:15.882 --> 00:03:23.507
"Focus!" Quinn stood up on her bike, and with a last burst of speed, pulled way ahead of

38
00:03:23.587 --> 00:03:29.254
Riley. Riley stood up too, pumping hard.

39
00:03:31.576 --> 00:03:34.878
Minutes later the two riders zipped toward the finish line.

40
00:03:35.599 --> 00:03:39.122
Quinn crossed first, with Riley following seconds later.

41
00:03:42.805 --> 00:03:49.971
Riley hadn't beaten Quinn over the finish line, but she'd scored one important victory—a better time than Quinn's!

42
00:03:49.991 --> 00:03:52.673
"I did it!"

43
00:03:53.214 --> 00:03:53.694
she thought.

44
00:03:54.435 --> 00:03:59.098
Riley crossed her fingers, hoping that her ride had also been good enough to beat all the other

45
00:03:59.138 --> 00:04:00.439
girls in the junior division.

46
00:04:01.459 --> 00:04:04.201
Quinn had turned off the track and thrown her bike down.

47
00:04:06.823 --> 00:04:08.744
Now she was collapsed on the grass.

48
00:04:10.805 --> 00:04:15.748
Riley rode straight to her parents and Jordan, who was doing her best to jump and clap while

49
00:04:15.808 --> 00:04:16.408
on crutches.

50
00:04:18.890 --> 00:04:22.652
Riley dropped her bike, and Jordan grabbed her in a crushing hug.

51
00:04:25.340 --> 00:04:27.221
"I knew you could nail those jumps!"

52
00:04:27.761 --> 00:04:28.802
Jordan kept yelling.

53
00:04:28.822 --> 00:04:30.603
"What a great ride!"

54
00:04:30.623 --> 00:04:37.467
"I should have made that one jump," Riley said after her sister and parents had stopped congratulating her.

55
00:04:37.487 --> 00:04:44.230
"But I had a really good fall—just like you taught me, Jordan—and that helped me stay in the

56
00:04:44.290 --> 00:04:48.593
race." Delaney came over to high-five Riley.

57
00:04:48.613 --> 00:04:53.135
"Way to go," he said.

58
00:04:53.155 --> 00:04:54.656
"You were awesome."

59
00:04:55.700 --> 00:04:57.021
Coach Adams joined them.

60
00:04:57.041 --> 00:05:00.143
"Nice run, Riley!"

61
00:05:00.563 --> 00:05:01.024
he said.

62
00:05:01.044 --> 00:05:04.266
"I'm especially impressed at your recovery from that fall."

63
00:05:04.286 --> 00:05:07.308
"Thanks," Riley replied.

64
00:05:07.328 --> 00:05:09.790
"I was pretty worried there for a second."

65
00:05:09.810 --> 00:05:13.832
"Well, you should be proud of your ride," Coach Adams said.

66
00:05:13.852 --> 00:05:17.114
"You showed a lot of guts and determination on the track."

67
00:05:17.134 --> 00:05:22.238
"I'll be prouder of my ride if I make the team," Riley said, grinning.

68
00:05:22.258 --> 00:05:25.140
"We'll see," Coach replied.

69
00:05:26.260 --> 00:05:30.221
"We'll announce the new team members after all the riders have finished their tryouts."

70
00:05:32.022 --> 00:05:37.863
While everyone waited for the last riders to finish, Riley went over to the grassy spot and dropped

71
00:05:37.923 --> 00:05:39.003
down beside Quinn.

72
00:05:40.804 --> 00:05:43.685
The other girl hadn't moved since she finished her ride.

73
00:05:44.565 --> 00:05:45.325
Quinn looked at her.

74
00:05:45.345 --> 00:05:46.906
"What do you want?"

75
00:05:47.566 --> 00:05:49.086
she asked in a tired voice.

76
00:05:49.106 --> 00:05:52.807
"To congratulate you," Riley said.

77
00:05:52.827 --> 00:05:55.348
"That was a fantastic ride.

78
00:05:56.116 --> 00:05:58.617
And you made a really nice recovery from that fall."

79
00:05:59.918 --> 00:06:01.919
Quinn narrowed her eyes suspiciously.

80
00:06:01.939 --> 00:06:03.820
"I doubt I made the team."

81
00:06:05.181 --> 00:06:05.921
Riley shrugged.

82
00:06:05.941 --> 00:06:11.965
"We'll see, but I think you and I are going to be junior Blue Demons."

83
00:06:11.985 --> 00:06:15.647
"I'm not so sure about me," Quinn mumbled.

84
00:06:15.667 --> 00:06:18.828
"But you had a really strong ride."

85
00:06:18.848 --> 00:06:22.090
"Thanks," Riley said.

86
00:06:22.110 --> 00:06:25.232
"How did you fall behind before that big jump?

87
00:06:25.516 --> 00:06:27.157
Did something happen on the track?"

88
00:06:28.278 --> 00:06:29.839
Quinn closed her eyes, sighing.

89
00:06:29.859 --> 00:06:34.622
"If I tell you, you'll just mock me for being a stupid snob."

90
00:06:35.802 --> 00:06:37.383
"No, I won't," Riley said.

91
00:06:37.403 --> 00:06:38.704
"Why would I do that?"

92
00:06:38.724 --> 00:06:45.108
"Because my fabulous, custom-designed bike has a fatal flaw," Quinn went on.

93
00:06:45.128 --> 00:06:46.829
"Its dumb rider."

94
00:06:47.850 --> 00:06:48.930
Riley was confused.

95
00:06:48.950 --> 00:06:51.052
"Huh?" Quinn looked away.

96
00:06:52.256 --> 00:06:55.939
"I was so sure my bike was perfect that I didn't bother doing a pre-race check.

97
00:06:56.739 --> 00:06:58.000
Some of the bolts were loose."

98
00:06:58.020 --> 00:07:01.082
"Oh Riley murmured.

99
00:07:01.102 --> 00:07:03.544
"That was pretty dumb, Quinn."

100
00:07:03.564 --> 00:07:09.648
"My bike felt strange when I started," Quinn went on, "but I thought it was the soft track.

101
00:07:10.629 --> 00:07:13.251
When I went over the first jumps, I realized what was happening.

102
00:07:13.871 --> 00:07:17.093
I was afraid if I hit that big jump too hard, something would fall off.

103
00:07:18.034 --> 00:07:20.636
That was what distracted me when I reached the tricky jump."

104
00:07:21.612 --> 00:07:23.473
"You're lucky," Riley said.

105
00:07:23.493 --> 00:07:25.954
"You could have had a bad accident."

106
00:07:25.974 --> 00:07:27.374
"I know.

107
00:07:28.215 --> 00:07:31.796
While you were chasing me, I kept thinking that my bike was about to fall apart."

108
00:07:32.437 --> 00:07:33.137
Quinn laughed.

109
00:07:33.157 --> 00:07:36.198
"But I still wanted to beat you."

110
00:07:37.339 --> 00:07:38.979
Riley was curious about something.

111
00:07:39.880 --> 00:07:41.900
"Why did you use the fall I showed you?"

112
00:07:43.821 --> 00:07:44.501
Quinn shrugged.

113
00:07:44.521 --> 00:07:48.243
"Because your way of falling doesn't knock down living room lamps."

114
00:07:49.383 --> 00:07:50.264
Riley grinned.

115
00:07:50.908 --> 00:07:52.369
"Or break as many bones!"

116
00:07:53.370 --> 00:07:57.093
Soon the last rider in all the divisions crossed the finish line.

117
00:07:57.913 --> 00:07:59.434
Riley jumped to her feet.

118
00:07:59.454 --> 00:08:01.656
"Come on, Quinn!"

119
00:08:02.076 --> 00:08:02.877
she said eagerly.

120
00:08:02.897 --> 00:08:06.339
"Coach Adams is finally going to announce the new team!"

121
00:08:07.540 --> 00:08:09.121
Quinn held up crossed fingers.

122
00:08:09.141 --> 00:08:14.345
"I don't have much hope, but maybe it'll be you and me in the junior division."

123
00:08:14.365 --> 00:08:16.747
"I think it will be!"

124
00:08:17.307 --> 00:08:18.108
Riley replied.
